    {
      "id": "2b28b3a3-42f7-44dd-8823-fbdb0b6f10d0",
      "title": "Compare as duas linhas e observe a função de cada uma.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "b7115499-6f68-4c15-8c76-d60a09de3c6f",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>¿Por qué...?</strong> aparece na pergunta.</p><p><strong>Porque...</strong> aparece na resposta.</p><ul><li><strong>¿Por qué publicas en las redes sociales?</strong></li><li><strong>Porque comparto fotos.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>porque</strong> fica em <strong>uma palavra</strong> e <strong>sem acento</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
